                <p>
                    Harriman sent a summary of the portion of
                    this memorandum here printed to Grew in
                    telegram No. 2523 of July 11 (file No. 740.0011 EW/7–1145) and the gist of this message was included in telegram
                    No. 19 of July 12 from Grew to Byrnes (file No. 740.00119 Potsdam/7–1245).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d232-f2" n="2" xml:id="d232-f2-content">
                <p>For the paragraphs omitted here, see <ref target="#d207">document No.
